<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Tømmerrenna at Steinsfoss — Steinsfoss–Beihølen flume return</name><desc>From the signed entrance at Steinsfoss near Vennesla, walk the historic timber-carrying channel to Beihølen and return the same way, crossing two suspension bridges and dark tunnel sections. The inactive channel beside the access road is not a pedestrian route.

